text Afternoon.
text I finish eating and consider what to do.
text Yesterday was hectic, so I want to relax a bit today.
text Thinking back, I can't help but smile wryly.
text I didn't expect to ever think about "relaxing at home."
text @[Tomoya]
text (I wonder what they're doing...?)
text I start thinking about the people who gather at the drama club room.
text It's nice outside today.
text It might be nice to wander around instead of running from something for a change.
