text I spend this holiday looking around town.
text Aside from there being more people than usual, not much else is different.
text I wander around aimlessly, not looking for anything in particular.
text It takes a lot to get myself out here, but I always end up doing the same things.
text Walking around without any particular purpose, I suddenly feel nervous.
text It's too much trouble to go to Sunohara's place...
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll just go to school...
text Mumbling that, I smirk to myself.
text I wouldn't expect to hear that from someone who's perpetually late and truant.
text Despite that, my legs carry me somewhere I don't really want to go.
