text When I enter the front field, I pass by club members running laps.
text I hear cries from the other fields that sound like the soccer team and baseball team competing against each other.
text @[Tomoya]
text All this effort on a day off...
text Just a short time ago, I would have resented them.
text Since club members are here, the school building should be open, too.
text I head to the shoe lockers.
