text The inside of the building is, as expected, empty.
text It may be different in the hall with all the club rooms.
text I subconsciously start heading to the drama club room, but I stop myself.
text Somewhere outside the window, I hear all sorts of sounds.
text It sounds like the concert band tuning up. A cacophony of noise from brass instruments.
text These sounds mix with cheers from the field.
text From the gym, I hear bamboo swords smacking against each other and the heavy sounds of bouncing balls.
text One strange sound is interwoven among all the others.
text It sounds like a saw cutting wood.
text I listen carefully, trying to pinpoint the origin of the sound.
text @[Tomoya]
text Is that...?
text I start walking again.
