text After climbing up the stairs of the old building, my supposition is confirmed.
text *Screech* *Screech* *Screech* *Screech* *Screech*
text I can hear a noise resembling a hacksaw up ahead.
text That means... it's coming from the library.
text There's only one person who would use a saw... I mean, a violin inside the library...
text As usual, the placard reads "Closed."
text Also as usual, the crooked sliding door is slightly ajar.
text Seeing that, I feel a slight sense of relief.
