text *Scree* *Scree* *Scree* *Scree* *Scree* *Scree* *Scree*
text She's playing a short melody over and over and over again.
text I guess practice tunes are all like that.
text The sound itself is as horrible as before, but she seems to be playing with more care than yesterday.
text *Creeeee* *Creeeee* *Creeeee* *Creeeee*
text She plays the same melody in a different pitch.
text I don't know too much about it, but this must be how beginners practice.
