text Phew...
text She wipes the sweat off her forehead, her chin remaining on the violin's chin rest.
sound CSY.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Not good enough.
sound CSZ.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text I have to surprise everyone...
text She then places the bow back on the strings.
