sound CT0.aac
text @[Kotomi]
text Who's there?
text I frantically push myself against the wall.
text After a few seconds of silence, I start to hear the noise again.
text *Scree* *Scree* *Scree* *Scree* *Scree* *Scree* *Scree*
text Her concentration must be faltering since her performance seems a little clumsier.
